WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.847 line:10%
Men yon devinèt. Misk sa a pa gen twoponin.

2
00:00:02.847 --> 00:00:05.033 line:10%
Kisa kalsyòm nan limen konsa?

3
00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:08.333 line:10%
Kalsyòm antre nan selil la atravè kanal tip L —

4
00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:11.633 line:10%
reseptè dihydropyridine yo, sa amlodipine ap bloke pita a.

5
00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:14.606 line:10%
Gen yon dezyèm wout. IP₃ louvri depo a,

6
00:00:14.606 --> 00:00:17.800 line:10%
epi retikilòm sakoplasmik la ajoute pwòp kalsyòm pa l.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.072 line:10%
Kalsyòm mare ak kalmodilin.

8
00:00:19.072 --> 00:00:22.725 line:10%
Konplèks sa a limen kinaz chèn lejè myozin nan,

9
00:00:22.725 --> 00:00:25.433 line:10%
ki mete yon fosfat sou myozin nan.

10
00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:26.428 line:10%
Kounye a règ la.

11
00:00:26.428 --> 00:00:29.962 line:10%
Se sèlman yon tèt ki fosforile ki ka kole sou aktin epi rale.

12
00:00:29.962 --> 00:00:32.500 line:10%
Sa ki pa fosforile yo rete la, san sèvi anyen.

13
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.878 line:10%
Wete fosfat la,

14
00:00:33.878 --> 00:00:36.633 line:10%
tèt la p ap lage. Sa se eta latch la.

15
00:00:36.633 --> 00:00:39.289 line:10%
Fosfataz chèn lejè myozin nan wete fosfat la.

16
00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:41.260 line:10%
Li pa t janm sispann travay —

17
00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:44.600 line:10%
tonis se senpleman balans ki genyen ant de anzim yo.

18
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:47.504 line:10%
Men tonis nan repo: kinaz la ap genyen yon ti kras.

19
00:00:47.504 --> 00:00:51.254 line:10%
Kounye a cAMP bloke l. Pa gen nouvo fosfat k ap mete,

20
00:00:51.254 --> 00:00:53.767 line:10%
epi fosfataz la genyen otomatikman.

21
00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:57.198 line:10%
Andotelyòm nan fè l nan lòt sans lan.

22
00:00:57.198 --> 00:01:01.119 line:10%
Oksid nitrik gaye travèse a, li limen gwanilat siklaz,

23
00:01:01.119 --> 00:01:05.162 line:10%
epi cGMP li fè a aktive fosfataz la.

24
00:01:05.162 --> 00:01:07.000 line:10%
Menm rezilta, anzim opoze.

25
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.425 line:10%
Asetilkolin dilate — men sèlman lè li

26
00:01:09.425 --> 00:01:11.694 line:10%
mande andotelyòm nan fè oksid nitrik la.

27
00:01:11.694 --> 00:01:14.119 line:10%
Domaje selil sa a, epi menm asetilkolin

28
00:01:14.119 --> 00:01:16.700 line:10%
nan pa fè anyen ditou. Gade l echwe.

29
00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:19.229 line:10%
Nitropwisid pa mande. Li pote oksid nitrik

30
00:01:19.229 --> 00:01:22.014 line:10%
la avè l epi li lage l anndan selil misk la menm.

31
00:01:22.014 --> 00:01:23.819 line:10%
Andotelyòm nan toujou mouri,

32
00:01:23.819 --> 00:01:25.733 line:10%
men veso a louvri kanmenm.

33
00:01:25.733 --> 00:01:26.769 line:10%
Amlodipine —

34
00:01:26.769 --> 00:01:29.770 line:10%
yon blokè kanal kalsyòm dihydropyridine ki dire lontan —

35
00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:33.079 line:10%
