36
00:01:33.079 --> 00:01:35.908 line:10%
Rezèv la desann, kinaz la fè silans,

37
00:01:35.908 --> 00:01:39.141 line:10%
fosfat yo soti, epi veso a louvri. Rezèv la desann

38
00:01:39.141 --> 00:01:42.483 line:10%
paske ponp yo pa t janm kanpe — SERCA,

39
00:01:42.483 --> 00:01:44.907 line:10%
PMCA ak echanjè sodyòm-kalsyòm nan. Bloke antre a,

40
00:01:44.907 --> 00:01:46.928 line:10%
